<metadata><name>Snowlands 0617 Old Mount Rose Highway</name><desc>out and back to waypoint 2; or continue as broken (legs do not join end to end). 3.8 miles up and back on the old highway or 3.2 miles for the loop trip (add 1.2 miles if you begin at the alternate start point). Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/06/0617_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
